# Hall sensor driver configuration
#

config HS_MH248_FYDE
	tristate "MH248 Hall sensor for Fyde devices"
	depends on OF && GPIOLIB
	help
	  Say Y here if you want to enable support for MH248 hall sensor
	  on Fyde devices. This driver provides lid switch functionality
	  for ChromeOS devices.

	  To compile this driver as a module, choose M here: the
	  module will be called mh248-fyde.
